From 670ebccbb080b703ecc2d0778ee264e53a378e8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sonali Naresh <sonanare@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 16:22:18 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] MAP R6.1: Add Operating Channel Change Notification (OCCN) &
 Query (OCQ) support

This patch implements support for IEEE1905 Operating Channel Change Notification (OCCN)
and Operating Channel Query (OCQ):
- Integrates new IEEE1905 message types and events for OCCN/OCQ in Agent and Controller flows.
- Adds TLV construction/parsing for operating channel query/notification.
- Enables OCCN propagation between devices per Multi-AP requirements.

Signed-off-by: Sonali Naresh <sonanare@qti.qualcomm.com>
